  "text": "Board of Elections - Montgomery County\nSearch\nHome\nVisit Montgomery County\nDiscover Uwharrie\nEconomic Development\nCommunity Profile\nSite & Building Search\nWorkforce & Talent\nInfrastructure & Development\nEducation & Training Partners\nIncentives\nEconomic Development Strategic Plan\nBroadband\nMontgomery County Hotel Market & Feasibility Study\nMontgomery County Creating Outdoor Recreation Economies Strategic Plan\nHousing\nGovernment\nBoard of Commissioners\nBOCC Video Live\nArchived Board of Commissioners Video\nDepartments\nCommunity Links\nNews and Events\nOccupancy Taxes\nHow Do I...?\nAdopt or Find a Pet\nPay My Water Bill Online\nSign Up For Emergency Notifications\nFind Open RFPs/RFQs\nView County Commission Agendas/Minutes\nView Code of Ordinances\nApply for Building Permit or Schedule Inspection\nPay Occupancy Taxes\nReport a Missing Road Sign\nSearch Real Estate / GIS\nGet to the County Buildings\nFind a Convenience Center\nApply for Employment\nReport a Water Leak\nView BOCC Meetings\nFind a Convenience Site\nDownload GIS Data\nEnroll Property in Voluntary Agricultural District\nBoard of Elections\nGovernment \u203a\nDepartments \u203a\nBoard of Elections\nOur Mission\nIn our belief that the right to vote is the very cornerstone of our American Democracy, our mission is to administer free, fair, and honest elections for all Montgomery County Citizens. We will represent our county as a positive governmental agency by our compliance with all Local, State, and Federal Election Laws. We will continually strive to maintain the integrity of the electoral process.\nGeneral Election 2026 Early Voting Plan - UNANIMOUS APPROVAL\n2026 General Election Notice - 11/03/2026\nLogic and Accuracy Testing on Voting Equipment is now Complete.\nFind your Sample Ballot here:\nhttps://www.ncsbe.gov/voting/sample-ballot\nNOTICE OF BOARD MEETING\n11/2026 General Election Meetings\nLocation:\nMontgomery County Board of Elections: 327 N Main St, Troy, NC 27371\nTo join the meeting virtually, please click the following link:\nhttps://teams.microsoft.com/meete/281877806448616?p=i8ZLVCBe3NVvTPPUbL\nThe public is invited to attend.\nPlease submit any requests or topics of discussion for the Board's Agenda to:\nMontgomery County Board of Elections\nAttn: Kimberly Walter, Director\nemail:\n[email protected]\nP.O. Box 607\nTroy, NC 27371\nStaff\nKimberly Walter, Director of Elections\nDonna Moore, Deputy Director of Elections\nBoard Members\nJohn J. Adams, Chairperson\nTeddi Benson (Dem), Secretary\nDree Wynkoop (Rep)\nDebbie Burris (Dem)\nKelsey Brown (Rep)\nParty Chairs\nLarry Kramer (Rep)\nKay Cagle-Kinch (Dem)\nAlso in\nBoard of Elections:\nElection Results\nBoard of Elections Meeting Minutes\nBoard of Elections Meeting Video\nBoard of Election Meeting Agendas\nAbsentee Ballot Request Form\nBoard of Elections Documents\nElections Employment Opportunities\nCandidate Filing\n2026 Election Calendar\nInterested In Becoming A Candidate\nElection Observers\n2025-2027 Appointed Precinct Officials\nBuffer Zone for Precincts\nContact Information\nNorth Carolina Board of Elections\nPolling Place Lookup\nVoter ID Information\nVoter Registration\nNC DMV NEWS\nContact Information\n327 N. Main St\nPO Box 607\nTroy, NC 27371\nPhone: (910) 572-2024\nFax: (910) 576-2118\nClick to Email\nMonday - Friday 8:00AM - 5:00PM\nMontgomery County\nPhone:\n(910) 576-4221\n,\nFax:\n(910) 576-4566\n102 East Spring Street\n|\nTroy\n,\nNC\n27371\nHome\nVisit Montgomery County\nDiscover Uwharrie\nEconomic Development\nCommunity Profile\nSite & Building Search\nWorkforce & Talent\nInfrastructure & Development\nEducation & Training Partners\nIncentives\nEconomic Development Strategic Plan\nBroadband\nMontgomery County Hotel Market & Feasibility Study\nMontgomery County Creating Outdoor Recreation Economies Strategic Plan\nHousing\nGovernment\nBoard of Commissioners\nBOCC Video Live\nArchived Board of Commissioners Video\nDepartments\nCommunity Links\nNews and Events\nOccupancy Taxes\nHow Do I...?\nAdopt or Find a Pet\nPay My Water Bill Online\nSign Up For Emergency Notifications\nFind Open RFPs/RFQs\nView County Commission Agendas/Minutes\nView Code of Ordinances\nApply for Building Permit or Schedule Inspection\nPay Occupancy Taxes\nReport a Missing Road Sign\nSearch Real Estate / GIS\nGet to the County Buildings\nFind a Convenience Center\nApply for Employment\nReport a Water Leak\nView BOCC Meetings\nFind a Convenience Site\nDownload GIS Data\nEnroll Property in Voluntary Agricultural District\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Montgomery County\n|\nAll rights reserved.\nWeb Design\nby Liaison.\nEconomic Development Web Development\nby New Media Campaigns.",
